# A project that depends on a real third-party library (GLFW) which is not
# even on disk yet - the build fetches it.

# "if !path/" (note the trailing slash) tests that a DIRECTORY does not
# exist. PreDepend.Cmd runs its command before dependencies are parsed, so
# the clone lands just in time for the Depend line below to find
# external/glfw/glfw.build. On later builds the folder exists and the whole
# block is skipped.
if !external/glfw/
{
    PreDepend.Cmd git clone https://github.com/AliElSaleh/glfw external/glfw
}

# One local library, one freshly cloned one - Depend treats them the same.
Depend libs/MyLib
Depend external/glfw

Assembly        MyProject
SourceDirectory src

# Build-and-run in one command (example 10).
.Run
